    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death Scourges is a linear and dark third person shooter mixed with tactical elements. You embody the captain of a special strike team consisting of four elite operators. Shoot, loot, craft and use your team to survive the unknown horror lurking in the depths of an underground research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SHED LIGHT INTO THE DARK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You're send to a mysterious underground facility and have to investigate a leak from one of your contact persons. The deeper you descend, the more truth unveils...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIRD PERSON COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Target your enemies with the classic over-the-shoulder perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE TEAM IS YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Giving your teammates efficient orders will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPON ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Make use of pistols, SMGs, shotguns, assault rifles, snipers and special weapons such as a flamethrower and even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Combine and choose your components and make decisions on what to take and what to leave.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death Scourges is a linear and dark third person shooter mixed with tactical elements. You embody the captain of a special strike team consisting of four elite operators. Shoot, loot, craft and use your team to survive the unknown horror lurking in the depths of an underground research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SHED LIGHT INTO THE DARK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You're send to a mysterious underground facility and have to investigate a leak from one of your contact persons. The deeper you descend, the more truth unveils...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIRD PERSON COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Target your enemies with the classic over-the-shoulder perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE TEAM IS YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Giving your teammates efficient orders will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPON ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Make use of pistols, SMGs, shotguns, assault rifles, snipers and special weapons such as a flamethrower and even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.poster.avif?t=1751194122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.webm?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198250/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.mp4?t=1751194122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Combine and choose your components and make decisions on what to take and what to leave.</p>",
